 causes:["Aggressive Wi-Fi sleep policy set to \"turn off Wi-Fi during sleep\" by default on some builds"],
 fixes:["Settings > Wireless & networks > Wi-Fi settings > Menu > Advanced > Wi-Fi sleep policy > set to \"Never\"","Forget the network and re-add it with the correct security type","Update to the latest carrier firmware version available for the device"],
 actions:[],
