 causes:["Springboard (home screen process) cache not refreshed after the update introducing widgets/App Library"],
 fixes:["Restart the device — this alone resolves most Springboard cache glitches","Remove and re-add the problem widget from the widget gallery (long-press home screen > +)","Reset Home Screen Layout: Settings > General > Transfer or Reset iPhone > Reset > Reset Home Screen Layout (non-destructive to data)"],
