 causes:["Large photo/video library syncing over a slow or unstable connection","iCloud storage quota reached, silently halting new uploads"],
 fixes:["Check Settings > [your name] > iCloud for available storage — a full iCloud plan stops syncing new photos entirely","Connect to a strong, stable Wi-Fi network and leave the device charging and unlocked for sync to make real progress","Toggle iCloud Photos off and back on (Settings > Photos) if the sync counter appears stuck rather than just slow","Upgrade the iCloud+ storage tier if the library has genuinely outgrown the current plan"],
